## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

### 3-Layer Authentication System

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Layer 1: Metrics Calculation                       │
│  - FAR (False Acceptance Rate)                      │
│  - FRR (False Rejection Rate)                       │
│  - EER (Equal Error Rate)                           │
│  - GAR, IRR (Genuine/Impostor Accept/Reject Rate)  │
└────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────┘
                     │
┌────────────────────▼────────────────────────────────┐
│  Layer 2: Spoofing Detection                        │
│  - Keystroke Liveness (timing variance)            │
│  - Heart Rate Plausibility (biological range)      │
│  - Touch Pressure Consistency (CV analysis)        │
│  Risk Levels: Safe/Low/Medium/High/Critical        │
└────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────┘
                     │
┌────────────────────▼────────────────────────────────┐
│  Layer 3: Authentication Decision                   │
│  - Neural Network Confidence [0, 1]                │
│  - Spoofing Risk Assessment                        │
│  - Final Score = Confidence × (1 - Spoofing)      │
│  Decision: Accept / Reject / RejectHighRisk       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Authentication Flow

```
Biometric Input (Keystroke, Touch, HR)
         ↓
    ┌────────────────────┐
    │  L0NN Learner      │  → confidence_score [0, 1]
    └────────────────────┘
         ↓
    ┌────────────────────┐
    │  Spoofing Detector │  → liveness_score [0, 1]
    │  (3-check system)  │  → risk_level
    └────────────────────┘
         ↓
    ┌────────────────────┐
    │  Decision Logic    │  → final_score = conf × live
    │  threshold = 0.5   │
    └────────────────────┘
         ↓
    Accept / Reject / RejectHighRisk
```

